            Instant.parse("2030-01-01T11:00:00Z"), E, "150", "300",
            LeaseMode.SHARED, "400"));

    LeaseService.ServiceResult rejected = leaseService.create(create(
            "new", Set.of("CELL-A"), S, E, "100", "300",
            LeaseMode.SHARED, "400"));
    assertThat(rejected.httpStatus()).isEqualTo(409);
